---

## ✅ Recursive Array Flatten Function

```js
function flattenRecursive(arr) {
  let result = [];

  for (const item of arr) {
    if (Array.isArray(item)) {
      result = result.concat(flattenRecursive(item)); // recurse
    } else {
      result.push(item); // base case
    }
  }

  return result;
}
```

---

## 📌 Example

